# The generated Merkleye API client: ~16k lines, fully derived from
# api/openapi.yaml. Same reasoning as merkleye's /ent/* — a generated artifact
# in the diff hides the change that produced it, and a stale committed copy is
# a contract drift waiting to happen. `mise run generate` after a clone.
/internal/merkleyeapi/client.gen.go

# Build artifact: api/openapi.yaml with the empty-string parameter unions
# collapsed so oapi-codegen can generate from it. See scripts/prepare-spec.py.
/api/openapi.codegen.yaml

/merkleye-mcp
/dist/
